{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_aydogdu",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "Halt there, gatekeeper! My eye scans the plain, my ear attends the bowstring. An old soldier rests only in the grave; what do you seek?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Sergeant, how stand the village battlements and sentry posts?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Horsemen dust was spotted at the skirts of Kösedağ; what precaution shall we take?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "What is your judgment regarding the nefers we admitted yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "The youngsters are too lax! I inspected the watch last night; two nodded off beside the parapet, so I prodded them with my spear butt. A sentry who sleeps on watch sends an invitation to his executioner!"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "Drive sharpened stakes into the ditch culverts! Dig wolf-pits before the water channel. When a charger steps into the pit, the rider hits the dirt; our archers in the tower will finish the work."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "I assigned the spearman from Sivas and the tower trumpeter to the barracks. One marked ambush defiles on the map, the other sounded the war horn. Both are veteran front-liners; they bolster our garrison."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_normal",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_kriz",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 0.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_karar",
